Server init.
>> a := Blob novo: 4.
a bytes: ( Listar novo ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob novo: 4.
b bytes: ( Listar novo ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a novo.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Saída escrever: ['xorred:'], stop. 
Saída escrever: n, stop. 
} pegar: { :e Saída escrever: e, stop. }, iniciar.
a livre.
b livre.
